{
 "name": "hippo_mouth_front",
 "description": "Boss shot: common hippo's mouth gaping wide like a doorway, front view. Upper jaw/head on top (y -1000..-640: broad muzzle with two big nostrils at (+-140,-835), small mean eyes at (+-222,-912), small ears at (+-140,-990)), lower jaw resting on the bank (y -140..0, pale plain chin centre for Doug). Flat dark pink-red interior #8e2e3e (deeper #6e1e2e at the back) x -390..390, y -632..-136; lower canines rise at x +-330 to y -424, short upper canines at x +-300, flat molars hinted at the back. The interior and molars are `label` boxes so that with `silhouette: true` the mouth stays open (background shows through) and reads as a gaping mouth from the outline. Anchor bottom-centre; 1100x1000 (x -550..550, y -1000..0).",
